# neck/woman/cowl: the T2 mantle's hood thrown back (neck cowl; D55, STYLE_P2 29.3): a soft roll 2-3 px thick round the
# neck facing D that closes the gap between the jaw and the shoulders, in the coat colour (cloth1) with its fold lit
# behind the ear facing R; the hood's lump behind the nape is drawn on the capelet (it lies over the mantle). Worn with
# pauldron capelet.2. Written by BODY tools/mantle.py (envelope fix round 1); re-run it, never hand-edit.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body woman
role neck cowl
layer neck
anchor neck
keys neck

